From 2cf9ded5d0efc8ae6aa62d3786dc9efa90df2167 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zcode <zcode@local>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 13:22:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] =?UTF-8?q?docs:=20conclusion=20=E2=80=94=20this=20car?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d=20is=208821CU=20silicon;=2088x2bu=20line=20retired?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

---
 CONCLUSION.md | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 CONCLUSION.md

diff --git a/CONCLUSION.md b/CONCLUSION.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..15581de
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CONCLUSION.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# 结论存档 2026-08-15
+
+本卡 c820 实为 8821CU 硅片（chip_id=0x09 为真实读数，非错读）。
+E2 的强制 chip_id=8822B 补丁是误诊——8822B 固件灌 8821C 导致 dlfw failed。
+本仓库整条 88x2bu 线为弯路，wlan 已由原厂 8821cu.ko + openEuler 同源 cfg80211/mac80211 修复。
+E1 的 c820 ID patch 与 E3 反汇编技术仍有参考价值。
+勿再向本卡加载 88x2bu。
-- 
2.34.1

